                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Editor’s Note</hi></head>
                <p>—<ref target="#d739">Document No. 739</ref>, <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>,
                    mentions a meeting of July 25 which considered the question of officers of the
                    Preparatory Commission of the United Nations and of the Executive Committee of
                    that Commission. It is not clear whether the meeting referred to was a bilateral
                    Anglo-American conversation or whether Soviet representatives participated as
                    well. It appears, however, that there were later tripartite discussions of this
                    subject at the Berlin Conference. See <ref target="#d743">document No.
                    743</ref>, <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>.</p>
            </div>
